---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | INVESThOuR"
  description="Learn about INVESThOuR and our approach to personal finance, investing and smarter financial decisions."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT INVESThOuR</p>

      <h1>
        Making money and investing
        <span>easier to understand.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-description">
        INVESThOuR is a content brand focused on breaking down personal
        finance, investing and financial decisions into simple,
        practical explanations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Why INVESThOuR?</h2>

      <p>
        Financial topics are often made unnecessarily complicated.
        INVESThOuR exists to make them easier to understand without
        removing the important details.
      </p>

      <p>
        From credit scores and mutual funds to IPOs, stocks and major
        financial decisions, the goal is to explain the numbers, the
        trade-offs and the things that are easy to overlook.
      </p>

      <p>
        The website expands on the ideas covered in our YouTube videos
        through detailed articles and additional context.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section muted">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="three-column">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">01</div>
          <h3>Simple</h3>
          <p>
            Complex financial concepts explained in clear,
            understandable language.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">02</div>
          <h3>Practical</h3>
          <p>
            Focused on real-world decisions rather than theory alone.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="icon">03</div>
          <h3>Data-driven</h3>
          <p>
            Numbers, comparisons and assumptions are made visible
            wherever they matter.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Our content</h2>

      <div class="topics">
        <span>Personal Finance</span>
        <span>Investing</span>
        <span>Mutual Funds</span>
        <span>Stocks</span>
        <span>IPOs</span>
        <span>Money Decisions</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta">
        <p class="eyebrow">START HERE</p>

        <h2>Learn something useful today.</h2>

        <p>
          Explore the latest videos or read the latest articles from
          INVESThOuR.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a href="/videos" class="primary-button">Watch Videos</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="secondary-button">Read the Blog</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 14px 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .about-hero h1 span {
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 90px 0;
  }

  .muted {
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .narrow h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .narrow p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .three-column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: white;
  }

  .icon {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .topics {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .topics span {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #374151;
    background: white;
  }

  .cta-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }

  .cta {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .cta p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #6b7280;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .primary-button,
  .secondary-button {
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .primary-button {
    background: #111827;
    color: white;
  }

  .secondary-button {
    border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
    background: white;
    color: #111827;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 65px 0;
    }

    .three-column {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .cta {
      padding: 40px 24px;
    }

    .actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .primary-button,
    .secondary-button {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>